[\"详细属性\"],\"row\":[[\"<p>（待角色上线后更新）</p>\"]]}},{\"tab_name\":\"天赋2（元素战技）\",\"desc\":\"<p></p>\",\"attr\":{\"tab_name\":\"\",\"header\":[\"详细属性\"],\"row\":[[\"<p>（待角色上线后更新）</p>\"]]}},{\"tab_name\":\"天赋3（元素爆发）\",\"desc\":\"<p></p>\",\"attr\":{\"tab_name\":\"\",\"header\":[\"详细属性\"],\"row\":[[\"<p>（待角色上线后更新）</p>\"]]}}]}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3118", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "技能展示", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "map_desc", "layout": "", "data": "{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"普通攻击\",\"image\":\"\"},{\"tab_name\":\"元素战技\",\"image\":\"\"},{\"tab_name\":\"元素爆发\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3119", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "角色CV", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "collapse_panel", "layout": "", "data": "{\"rich_text\":\"<p>中：<span style=\\\"color: rgb(24, 25, 28)\\\">苏尚卿</span></p><p>日：<span style=\\\"color: rgb(24, 25, 28)\\\">小林裕介</span></p><p>英：</p><p>韩：</p>\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3121", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "立绘展示", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "map_desc", "layout": "", "data": "{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色立绘1\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/10/23/50494840/81aabf81ffdf983a0ee898144611fb40_763241388797345944.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"角色立绘2\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/10/23/50494840/0f51b93dad45003038aeb914961f25b2_5596013862401754451.png\"}]}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3120", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "更多描述", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "collapse_panel", "layout": "", "data": "{\"rich_text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">▌列律名虚 · 米提亚</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">锐思灵慧，笑语玄机 </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">========== </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">「研究与生产不同，效率并非黄金标尺。我曾与许多天赋异禀之人共事，亦知晓才华与古怪往往成正比，但唯一不会令人失望的，就是他们给出的『答案』。」</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">——「丑角」皮耶罗在面对米提亚疑似拥有特权的质疑时的回答</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">「我申请提高其围巾的协助保密权限，因为在绝大多数的防泄露审查中，旁听者都是无辜的。」</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">——「特殊任务营」领队瓦列里 </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">专家通常具有极高的效率，能在有限的时间里产出令人瞠目结舌的成果，但另一方面，以普通科研人员的效率为参考而设立的「出勤考核」，对专家而言则是囚笼。</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">时光若是虚度倒也容易，可是世界分明要精彩得多，错过了那些五颜六色岂不可惜？</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">于是，理应要务缠身的能源专家，时常出现在至冬堡的大街小巷，享受着以才华置换的空闲。</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">有时是去欣赏科洛列夫茨基剧团的新剧目，有时是在老庭院餐厅与陌生的客人拼桌，有时是找个晴天清洗并晾晒自己的好伙伴围巾…</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">旁人看来科研者应该全情投入，至少也要避免不务正业，可他会辩称不热爱生活的人又怎么能将工作做好？</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">若以航海家为比喻，缜密的逻辑推理就像是在绘制精确的海图，而灵魂闪光的瞬间就像是望远镜中突然出现了新大陆的轮廓，显然是后者贡献更为杰出，也更令人欣喜若狂。</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">于是他将这一切「不合理」整理成书信、提案、假条等形式，将它们置于研究报告的最后一页共同提交，希望能够得到上级的注意。</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">后来他成功了——由于随性修改日程的情况愈演愈烈，且多次擅自将缺勤的情况说明改写成上述抗辩，他获得了一位非常重视时间规划的少校来支持他的工作，可喜可贺。 </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(47, 50, 56)\\\">========== </span></p>\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3123", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": true, "switch": true, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "角色详细", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "collapse_panel", "layout": "", "data": "{\"rich_text\":\"<p></p>\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3124", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": true, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "配音展示", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "role_voice", "layout": "", "data": "{\"moduleName\":\"配音展示\",\"layout_\":\"banner\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"汉语\",\"table\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"audio_url\":\"\",\"isUploading\":false}],\"tab_id\":\"1708445024189_0\"}]}", "style": ""}], "id": "3125", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "媒体资料", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "strategy", "layout": "", "data": "{\"moduleName\":\"媒体资料\",\"layout_\":\"banner\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"锐思灵慧，笑语玄机\",\"cover\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/10/23/50494840/abf6801d06c40cea3f0d309ebdcf8333_21106031