环之外\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509907/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509907/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">闭环之外</span></span></a></span><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"510050\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/30/50494840/a17f442d88218171cb82f20b553639d0_1676622756793906438.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沃雅妮莎【逸闻】\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/510050/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/510050/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/30/50494840/a17f442d88218171cb82f20b553639d0_1676622756793906438.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">沃雅妮莎【逸闻】</span></span></a></span><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509638\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/18/5787925/5c42cf27c2c664c387fe403893529bbf_1573239378885435692.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"阿罗夏【洞天】\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509638/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509638/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/18/5787925/5c42cf27c2c664c387fe403893529bbf_1573239378885435692.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">阿罗夏【洞天】</span></span></a></span></p>\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "3129", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "角色关联语音", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "collapse_panel", "layout": "", "data": "{\"rich_text\":\"<table class=\\\"tableWrapperContent\\\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><strong>角色</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><strong>关于米提亚…</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509804\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"big\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/b9c34f2a1e0428379eb4977e5d4c8d01_1949166060657091505.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沃雅妮莎\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509804/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509804/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-icon\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; width: unset; align-items: center\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"image\\\"><img src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/b9c34f2a1e0428379eb4977e5d4c8d01_1949166060657091505.png\\\"></span><span class=\\\"name\\\">沃雅妮莎</span></span></a></span></p></td><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p>希望这位聪明的先生不要在剧院的观众席上继续解题了，我们剧院不是什么超级自习室，也不是逃避工作的避难所，请认真地享受演出。不然我就…呼，算了，我也不能做什么，他确实很遵守剧院的观演礼仪。哼，下次我要挑一首动静大点的曲子，我看他还能不能顺利地解题。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509803\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"big\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/5bcf5ee7c692438cddade96a313eab90_6022903438430751754.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"薇斯纳\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509803/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509803/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-icon\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; width: unset; align-items: center\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"image\\\"><img src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/5bcf5ee7c692438cddade96a313eab90_6022903438430751754.png\\\"></span><span class=\\\"name\\\">薇斯纳</span></span></a></span></p></td><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p>米提亚是我固定的游戏玩伴，他总能想办法从军械宫溜出来，我们三个每次都玩得很尽兴！哪来的三个？我，米提亚，还有他那条聪明的围巾。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509103\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"big\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/04/50494840/739bbb437b9c7b38f87bc1fcad395def_7161795407666485206.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"奥黛塔\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509103/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509103/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-icon\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; width: unset; align-items: center\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"image\\\"><img src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/04/50494840/739bbb437b9c7b38f87bc1fcad395def_7161795407666485206.png\\\"></span><span class=\\\"name\\\">奥黛塔</span></span></a></span></p></td><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p>这位…「粉丝」先生，他经常来剧院观看我和沃雅妮莎的表演。但每次表演开始，他都在低着头写些什么，在一众翘首看向舞台的观众中很是醒目。或许他的围巾比他更懂得欣赏演出。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" colwidth=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509104\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"big\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/04/50494840/d25f426b7848a677a73fe4cd95e3485a_6345854338570802141.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"阿罗夏\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509104/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509104/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-icon\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; width: unset; align-items: center\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"image\\\"><img src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/04/50494840/d25f426b7848a677a73fe4cd95e3485a_6345854338570802141.png\\\"></span><span class=\\\"name\\\">阿罗夏</span></span></a></span></p></td><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><p>我没有正经读过书，所以我以为自己和米提亚这样的人会很难相处，后来他主动帮我改装了几次枪械之后，我才明白这样的担心十分多余。米提亚这个人很好说话，只要把他当成一个邻家少年就行。唯一需要注意的点，可能就是在他念叨那些「科学黑话」的时候，不要打扰他。</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "4976", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}], "filter_values": {}, "menu_id": "0", "menu_name": "", "version": "1793064306", "langs": [], "template_layout": {"tab": [{"tab_id": "272", "tab_name": "页签1", "module_group": [{"module_gr